␀␀,"status":"␀","current_version":"␀␀␀","latest_version":"␀␀␀␀","update_available":␀␀␀,"checking":␀␀␀␀,"check_age_sec":␀␀␀bad␀/ota␀␀␀␀<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'>␀␀␀<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2032%2032%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%2232%22%20height%3D%2232%22%20rx%3D%228%22%20fill%3D%22%230ea5e9%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M5%2022l5-7v-3a6%206%200%200%201%2012%200v1l5%202-5%202c-1%207-9%2010-17%205Z%22%20fill%3D%22white%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M10%2018q5%205%209-2%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%230284c7%22%20stroke-width%3D%222%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%2F%3E%3Ccircle%20cx%3D%2218.5%22%20cy%3D%2211.5%22%20r%3D%221.2%22%20fill%3D%22%230f172a%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E">␀␀<meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>␀<title>Firmware update</title><link rel='stylesheet' href='/ota.css'></head><body data-ota-checking='␀␀␀' data-ota-allowed='␀␀␀␀'><div id='ota-progress' class='ota-progress' role='alert' aria-live='assertive'><div class='ota-progress-box'><div class='spinner'></div><h2 id='ota-progress-title'>Installing firmwareâ€¦</h2><p id='ota-progress-text'>Do not disconnect power or close this page.</p><button type='button' id='ota-reconnect' hidden>Check connection again</button></div></div><div class='wrap'>␀<div class='card'><h1>Firmware update</h1><p class='muted'>Device: <code>␀␀␀</code><br>Current firmware: <strong>v␀␀</strong><br>Board: <strong>␀␀␀␀</strong> / ␀␀␀␀</p><p><a class='btn secondary' href='/'>Back to Web UI</a></p></div>␀␀␀<div class='msg ␀␀␀␀'>␀␀<p id='ota-preparation-required' class='msg' role='status'␀␀ hidden␀<div class='card'><h2>Automatic update</h2><p class='muted'>Use this when the device has internet access. It downloads the latest board-specific app build from the project web flasher and installs it automatically.</p>␀␀<div class='version-state current'>Checking for firmware updates in the backgroundâ€¦</div>␀<div class='version-state bad'>Update check failed: ␀␀␀␀<div class='version-state update'>New firmware available: v␀</div><form id='ota-install-form' method='post' action='/ota/install'><button type='submit'␀>Download and install v␀</button></form>␀␀␀␀<div class='version-state current'><strong>Firmware is up to date.</strong><br><span class='muted'>Latest available: v␀␀</span></div>␀␀␀<p><a class='btn secondary' href='/ota?refresh=1'>Check again</a></p><p class='muted'>Firmware file: <code>␀</code></p>␀<p class='bad'>Automatic update is unavailable for this board profile. Upload a matching app-only firmware file manually.</p>␀␀␀<div class='card'><h2>Upload compiled file</h2><p class='muted'>Use this when the device has no internet access. Select the matching app-only file such as <code>firmware-app-c3.bin</code>, <code>firmware-app-s3.bin</code>, <code>firmware-app-c5.bin</code>, or <code>firmware-app-c6.bin</code>. Do not upload the USB <code>firmware.bin</code> merged image here.</p>␀␀␀␀<form id='ota-upload-form' method='post' action='/ota/upload' enctype='multipart/form-data'>␀␀␀␀<input type='file' name='firmware' accept='.bin,application/octet-stream' required␀␀><button type='submit'␀␀>Upload and install file</button></form></div>␀␀<script src='/ota.js'></script>␀</div></body></html>␀␀␀␀Cache-Control␀␀␀no-store␀␀␀␀text/html; charset=utf-8␀␀␀␀refresh␀X-ESP32MIC-OTA-Reboot␀␀␀Firmware uploaded and installed. Device will reboot now.␀␀␀␀Upload failed: ␀forbidden␀␀␀Stop and save recording before updating firmware.␀␀␀Update preparation is in progress. Please wait.␀firmware.bin␀␀␀␀firmware-␀␀␀firmware-app-␀␀␀OTA upload start: ␀␀Update begin failed: ␀␀␀Flash write failed: ␀␀␀␀Update end failed: ␀Update was not fully written.␀␀␀OTA upload installed, bytes=␀␀␀␀Upload aborted.␀/ota/install␀␀␀␀/ota/upload␀/api/ota_status␀Automatic update is unavailable for this board profile.␀/updates/ota-version.txt␀␀␀␀Could not open the firmware version URL.␀␀